Title: "Overview"
Id: "4f8cf47d-3b81-45db-8104-f888b3cc3ada"

Text: "```mlg-fragment
TopLevelItemUnion ::=
    | TitleGroup
    | SectionTitleGroup
    | SubsectionTitleGroup
    | TextGroup
    | TopLevelWritingGroup
    | DisambiguatesGroup
    | DescribesGroup
    | DefinesGroup
    | RefinesGroup
    | StatesGroup
    | AxiomGroup
    | TheoremGroup
    | CorollaryGroup
    | PersonGroup
    | ResourceGroup
    | SpecifyGroup
    | RelationGroup
    | EquivalentGroup
    | TopicGroup
```

The group kind is determined by the first section label. Definition-like cards
also require or receive an `Id:` during `mlg check`; duplicate ids are errors.

`Lemma:`, `Conjecture:`, `Represents:`, and `Subsubsection:` are no longer part
of the structural language."
Id: "0458cfe8-4b85-4c0f-8fbb-7d78e5cb80f5"
